      },
      "text": "River in Peru: green banks seen from a boat"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_title:2fb5525f94c7ffcd",
      "field": "itinerary.title",
      "sourceTextSha256": "b73f32f0fcad1f74cc9a98f2a14a39307785ad4281166bc327c679ed2cca10fb",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-translator-20261110-da7adf1e0510432f",
        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      },
      "text": "The Amazon: birdwatching, fishing and pink dolphins"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:fb5db666cae6efb7",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "17212761a85cd8cce2be4049b2bd10e3a92460533622b0d071ae5e92b83417e4",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-translator-20261110-da7adf1e0510432f",
        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      },
      "text": "Full board at the lodge.\n\nThe day starts with a birdwatching trip. After the early outing, you’ll return to the lodge for breakfast.\n\nNext, you’ll go fishing on the Amazon. The lodge can cook your catch. Before lunch, you’ll head out to look for pink river dolphins.\n\nAfter lunch, you’ll take a boat to see giant Victoria regia water lilies. You’ll then visit a local community that has lived on the banks of the Amazon for generations and learn about its daily life and traditions.\n\nAfter dinner, you’ll take a night walk through the jungle. The forest looks and sounds different after dark, so the walk gives you another perspective on what you saw during the day."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_label:b8c7889f40813b65",
      "field": "itinerary.label",
      "sourceTextSha256": "8d675ffb04c1634d669a82c229393f9d17bd47b0b11065acff958b44101be168",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-translator-20261110-da7adf1e0510432f",
        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      },
      "text": "Iquitos"
    },
