        "runId": "ada-en-translator-20261110-da7adf1e0510432f",
        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      },
      "text": "The Amazon to Iquitos and Lima"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:c3205ac1e20a266d",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "ae92cccf46ebf2ca8c41ff0bb092932ce1a1fe2a1b61fd63b3c361fa64a3fd95",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-translator-20261110-da7adf1e0510432f",
        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      },
      "text": "Full board.\n\nIn the morning, you’ll take a boat to visit a local community. There you’ll see how people make alcoholic and non-alcoholic drinks from sugar cane and have a chance to taste them.\n\nReturn to the lodge for lunch, then take a speedboat to Iquitos.\n\nAt the scheduled time, transfer to the airport for your flight to Lima. On arrival, you’ll be met and taken to your hotel to check in."
    }
  ]
